      "value": "I can see this sociological problem. The beacon on the nameplate helps whom? Perhaps help remember this friend is the best buddy out of all friends? Such thoughts should stay personal.   Yes keep the bookmark system as a easy access to whom one normally joins on in a crowded list of friends.",
